{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》重頭戲「極速狂奔」向動作特技人員致敬，29歲新一代打女劉穎鏇（Tiffany）聯同張 …</p><p></p>\n<p>《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》重頭戲「極速狂奔」向動作特技人員致敬，29歲新一代打女劉穎鏇（Tiffany）聯同張振朗及周嘉洛與朱敏瀚挑戰連串超高難度特技，將現場氣氛推至頂峰。這段長達數分鐘演出得到網民高度讚賞！</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510499277238276_547753826aff20e1a0893.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"photo_2026-11-20 00.06.32.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510499277238276_547753826aff20e1a0893.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>凌空鉸剪腳！ 動作自然流暢且極具力量感。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>29歲劉穎鏇親身上陣演繹凌空鉸剪腳絕技</h2>\n<p>29歲小花劉穎鏇在《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》中化身最強打女，親身上陣挑戰極高要求武打動作，與「錢家班」的武師對打，毫不怯場地使出凌空鉸剪腳等高難度招式，動作自然流暢且極具力量感。為了完美應付這類激烈動作場面，她早前曾接受嚴格特訓將體脂率維持在10%極限狀態，成功展現監製文偉鴻從《超能使者》及《隱形戰隊》開始為她塑造的性感打女形象。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17951049948007130_14327896056aff20e32945d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"photo_2026-11-19 23.44.30.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17951049948007130_14327896056aff20e32945d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>極速狂奔 Speed &amp; Stunt由四位新晉小生花旦演出，（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510499666238855_7020316416aff20e56fb3e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"2b2ce4e8-ecdd-4c0b-94ad-94431a4a4a7c.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510499666238855_7020316416aff20e56fb3e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>好好身手！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>張振朗領軍飛車致敬幕後特技團隊付出</h2>\n<p>這場名為極速狂奔驚險場面並非單純為了刺激觀眾眼球，四人熱血沸騰演出「亦是向一眾辛苦付出的幕後動作演員及特技人致敬」。視帝張振朗在環節中展示型爆飛車特技，加上各種危險動作背後，全賴動作組不辭勞苦默默準備，這次演出旨在肯定特技團隊多年來為影視作品付出的無數汗水。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510499976965300_19801533986aff20e827351.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"fb2ff2ec-afcf-4712-9951-319ec02204bd.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510499976965300_19801533986aff20e827351.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510500257662483_20050477896aff20eb19577.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"9a0ebf55-90a8-4698-b30e-93b3e5127ab8.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510500257662483_20050477896aff20eb19577.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>表演環節有一半預早錄影，其後打到入直播一號廠！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>網民激讚最強打女展現無可挑剔完美身段</h2>\n<p>大批觀眾看完這段精彩演出後，紛紛在網上留言將焦點集中在劉穎鏇身上。有網民直接留言指「最搶眼係動作女神最強Body“劉穎鏇”呀！」，對其專業武打水準給予高度評價。另有觀眾留言大讚「Tiffany 靚， 身材超fit，超有型，打得好型」，網絡平台上充斥大量針對她個人武打動作與身段的正面回饋。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17951050058623803_361600706aff20ee56f82.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"b135d48b-4488-4385-8cf7-73f868bbaf14.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17951050058623803_361600706aff20ee56f82.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510500746927579_16176366236aff20f010b43.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"502345a2-5a4b-4eee-ac6f-fca95dce5548.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510500746927579_16176366236aff20f010b43.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Tiffany的演出獲錢嘉樂讚賞！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<h2>觀眾點評四大演員驚險演出為全晚最佳</h2>\n<p>除了針對個人表現外，整體四人演出同樣獲得網民壓倒性好評，被大量留言公認為當晚最精彩環節。不少網民熱烈留言表示「全晚最精彩，最好看！！！」及「台慶咁多環節!呢part係最驚喜最精彩!」，表達對極速狂奔特技的熱愛。更有觀眾點出四人合作火花，留下「4個極有喜感，幾搞笑，動作又好」以及「Good Team」等字眼。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462727901758536_663700426af7d6cf702d6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462727901758536_663700426af7d6cf702d6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462727719841993_8237553216af7d6cda685d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462727719841993_8237553216af7d6cda685d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462728464183702_10031587606af7d6d4ef02e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462728464183702_10031587606af7d6d4ef02e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510500970697312_9832554776aff20f21397e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510500970697312_9832554776aff20f21397e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%8a%89%e7%a9%8e%e9%8f%87/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">劉穎鏇</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%bc%b5%e6%8c%af%e6%9c%97/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張振朗</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%90%ac%e5%8d%83%e6%98%9f%e8%bc%9d%e8%b3%80%e5%8f%b0%e6%85%b62026/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬千星輝賀台慶2026</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3546399\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 20 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T21:24:06.676057+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1369,"images":11,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T16:16:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T00:17:33.107418+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T21:17:34.775783+00:00","content_hash":"fdd2ffe68af1b9de1c381a767772781c1cf46f209758ef8478a396de7f3c54ea","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}